  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0120_234cec6efb3c.jpeg\" /><br />Slope of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><br />Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br />From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>,<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />So, locus is <math><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi></math>."
  }
